["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"发券、裂变、极速版，如何用红包设计增长？丨字节跳动 第8集 K因子 (K-factor) RY1/RY2/RY3 红包中台\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-12-luanfanshu-极速版的本质不是增长-是商业化和算法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42a856e6750ff434-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"乱\"><span class=\"dur\">2:59:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">乱翻书</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0612</span></div>\n<h2>极速版红包不是增长，是算法和商业化的收割机</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人口红利消失后，红包、极速版、发券这套玩法的核心不是增长，而是用商业化和算法承接流量；AI时代买量接近失灵，增长回到模型能力与心智营销。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">用户增长</span><span class=\"tag\">极速版</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"144. 对阳萌的4小时访谈：消费电子死与生、第三类公司、端侧模型、产品方法、游戏模式 存算一体 冯诺依曼架构 N-time efficiency worker SackKit 康威定律\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-08-zhangxiaojun-安克做芯片-从五系到七系-一家消费电子公司的补课/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/99b672a2ad0c5ace-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:38:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0608</span></div>\n<h2>安克做芯片：从五系到七系，一家消费电子公司的补课</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安克前11年顺风顺水，2022年却发现自己建的产品线打不过外面的独角兽。阳萌的解法不是换人，而是把公司从五系产品公司改造成七系创新公司——代价是补上第一性、求极致、共成长这套价值观。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费电子</span><span class=\"tag\">存算一体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Reinventing Entropy | Compression is Intelligence Part 1 prefix-free code noiseless coding theorem entropy rate cross-entropy loss\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-07-karpathy-压缩就是智能-预测与压缩是同一枚硬币的两面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/911ed142cc051a24-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">32:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0607</span></div>\n<h2>压缩就是智能：预测与压缩是同一枚硬币的两面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">信息论说预测和压缩在数学上等价，所以语言模型的预训练目标可以重新理解为造一台最高效的文本压缩器，而不只是预测下一个 token。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信息论</span><span class=\"tag\">压缩</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"266: If ADHD Medication Doesn’t Help Kids Learn, What Does? MTA study crossover design DSM misrecognition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-01-parentmojo-adhd-药物改得了行为-改不了学习/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">30:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0601</span></div>\n<h2>ADHD 药物改得了行为，改不了学习</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Barkley 把 ADHD 比作糖尿病，但 64% 的人会反复移出诊断标准；药物提高服从性却不改善学习，MTA 长期随访证实无学业优势，真正有效的是小班差异化教学。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">儿童教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"143. 对何小鹏的第二次访谈：更大赌注、人形机器人Iron诞生、那场意外、技术剧变下CEO、GX和缝合怪 VLA 缝合怪 SOP T1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-28-zhangxiaojun-何小鹏-通用人形机器人99-99-会死-我们赌那两成胜率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/392e7ab9c3c64df9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0528</span></div>\n<h2>何小鹏：通用人形机器人99.99%会死，我们赌那两成胜率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鹏把花了小几十亿的自动驾驶体系整个停掉，因为用软件方法论加AI工具箱做出来的只是「AI缝合怪」。他给通用人形机器人的胜率是两成，而机器人创业难度是造车的20到100倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"142. 雨森的创投观察第2集：Harness、下一个字节、2026大机会和Stanley Druckenmiller Harness context engineering sandbox out of distribution agency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-27-zhangxiaojun-harness-才是操作系统-模型只是插拔的处理器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38abc82541e9f530-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:18:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0527</span></div>\n<h2>Harness 才是操作系统，模型只是插拔的处理器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司做的是提炼基础油的炼油厂，真正值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司。用户对 Harness 更忠诚——他会换模型，但不想换掉存着自己记忆的那个壳。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 应用</span><span class=\"tag\">Harness</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"141. Freda的投资札记第2集：Tokenmaxxing、把电机塞进蒸汽机、接力赛变篮球赛、孤独、人的连接 Tokenmaxxing recursive self-improvement economic diffusion Neo Labs Acquire Hire\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-18-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代最稀缺的不是信息-是有人味的对话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86731af431732da4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0518</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代最稀缺的不是信息，是有人味的对话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当 90% 到 95% 的信息性内容都能直接问 AI 拿到，以信息交换为目的的对话正在被掏空，人和人之间剩下的只有情感连接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投资</span><span class=\"tag\">模型公司</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ferrari Tifosi Classiche Purosangue\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-13-acquired-法拉利-卖的不是车-是排他与包容的悖论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b28a1307f172ac6a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:59:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0413</span></div>\n<h2>法拉利年产1.4万辆，市值却超福特：卖的是排他，也是包容</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法拉利年产仅1.4万辆，市值却超福特。秘诀在于同时拥有奢侈品的排他性和运动队的包容性，用稀缺性制造神话，用社群维持忠诚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法拉利</span><span class=\"tag\">奢侈品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"49 - Caspar Oesterheld on Program Equilibrium program equilibrium Löb&#x27;s theorem folk theorem epsilon grounded fairbot simulationist programs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-18-axrp-程序均衡-交代码比交人更可能合作-但协调极难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd45e667daa75191-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:32:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0218</span></div>\n<h2>程序均衡：交代码比交人更可能合作，但协调极难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">程序均衡让双方互读源代码，用 Löb 定理实现合作；但合作依赖几乎相同的代码或共享随机数，现实中协调成本极高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">博弈论</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"48 - Guive Assadi on AI Property Rights rentier racing to the precipice Roko&#x27;s basilisk Laplace&#x27;s rule of succession\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-15-axrp-给-ai-产权-是为了防止它掀桌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8a8ac42151ce3e12-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:05:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0215</span></div>\n<h2>给 AI 产权，是为了防止它掀桌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果 AI 拥有产权，它们就更不愿意破坏产权制度本身——包括抢走人类全部财产。这不是道德关怀，是风险对冲。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 治理</span><span class=\"tag\">产权</span>\n</div></div></a>"]